      ],
      "text": "2.2 Systematic screening for TB disease among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.472900390625,
        415.1195068359375,
        112.26789855957031
      ],
      "text": "people with structural risk factors for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        126.23981475830078,
        516.2786865234375,
        140.6828155517578
      ],
      "text": "2. Systematic screening for TB disease may be conducted among subpopulations with structural",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        138.2398223876953,
        515.7607421875,
        152.6828155517578
      ],
      "text": "risk factors for TB. These include urban poor communities, homeless communities, communities",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        150.2398223876953,
        502.19561767578125,
        164.6828155517578
      ],
      "text": "in remote or isolated areas, indigenous populations, migrants, refugees, internally displaced",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        162.2398223876953,
        482.1502990722656,
        176.6828155517578
      ],
      "text": "persons and other vulnerable or marginalized groups with limited access to health care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        175.6978302001953,
        476.1822814941406,
        192.93482971191406
      ],
      "text": "existing recommendation: conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence ( ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        220.40953063964844,
        328.89447021484375,
        238.67953491210938
      ],
      "text": "2.2.1 Summary of evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        245.38551330566406,
        527.6146850585938,
        259.8285217285156
      ],
      "text": "Populations with structural risk factors for TB are those that are at increased risks of TB and of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.58538818359375,
        527.4443969726562,
        273.0284118652344
      ],
      "text": "poor health outcomes from TB due to structural determinants in their environment, defined as the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        271.7855224609375,
        527.5061645507812,
        286.2285461425781
      ],
      "text": "conditions that generate or reinforce social stratification (e.g. socioeconomic inequalities, population",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99945068359375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        284.98553466796875,
        527.605712890625,
        299.4285583496094
      ],
      "text": "growth, urbanization), and therefore give rise to an unequal distribution of key social determinants of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992096900939941,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        298.18548583984375,
        527.3927612304688,
        312.6285095214844
      ],
      "text": "TB epidemiology, such as poor housing, poverty and malnutrition, which in turn influence exposure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.59149169921875,
        527.4126586914062,
        325.8285217285156
      ],
      "text": "(16,17) to risk, vulnerability and ability to recover after developing the disease  . Structural risk factors",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.58551025390625,
        527.5909423828125,
        339.0285339355469
      ],
      "text": "for TB include poverty; malnutrition; overcrowded and poorly ventilated living, working and gathering",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977276802062988,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.7854919433594,
        527.2855224609375,
        352.228515625
      ],
      "text": "conditions; and limited or no access to health care. These risk factors are not mutually exclusive nor do",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.967702865600586,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.9855041503906,
        527.4508056640625,
        365.42852783203125
      ],
      "text": "they exclude the clinical risk factors described in other recommendations, and they often compound",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        364.1855163574219,
        131.3925018310547,
        378.6285400390625
      ],
      "text": "one another.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        385.889404296875,
        527.4620971679688,
        400.3324279785156
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation has not been changed from the 2013 guidelines as, since the last GDG meeting,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966499328613281,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        399.08941650390625,
        527.5509033203125,
        413.5324401855469
      ],
      "text": "no new evidence was found to inform the question of the impact of systematic screening for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        412.2893981933594,
        527.6475219726562,
        426.732421875
      ],
      "text": "disease compared with passive case-finding practices in these risk groups. Observational studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.4894104003906,
        527.3969116210938,
        439.93243408203125
      ],
      "text": "during 2013–2020 suggest that TB screening conducted among populations affected by structural",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.68939208984375,
        527.2141723632812,
        453.1324157714844
      ],
      "text": "risk factors may initially increase TB case notifications and decrease TB prevalence; however, all studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97467041015625,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.889404296875,
        179.89242553710938,
        466.3324279785156
      ],
      "text": "had a major risk of bias.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        476.7560119628906,
        301.88427734375,
        495.0260314941406
      ],
      "text": "2.2.2 Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.73193359375,
        527.3970947265625,
        516.1749267578125
      ],
      "text": "Due to the inherent lack of access to health care that defines the risk groups described in this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.931884765625,
        527.4301147460938,
        529.3748779296875
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, screening interventions would need to be conducted in and extended into the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.1318969726562,
        527.3959350585938,
        542.5748901367188
      ],
      "text": "communities where members of these populations live and work in order to achieve effective reach",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.3319091796875,
        136.1761932373047,
        555.77490234375
      ],
      "text": "and coverage.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.035888671875,
        527.415771484375,
        577.4788818359375
      ],
      "text": "The list of potential populations affected by structural risk factors included in this recommendation is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.23583984375,
        527.446533203125,
        590.6788330078125
      ],
      "text": "not exhaustive, and this recommendation may apply to other groups with a high risk of TB and who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        589.435791015625,
        447.1888732910156,
        603.8787841796875
      ],
      "text": "have poor access to health care, including poor access to high-quality TB services.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.1397705078125,
        527.4144897460938,
        625.582763671875
      ],
      "text": "There is no evidence about the effectiveness of different screening intervals; in the absence of such",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.33984375,
        527.6259155273438,
        638.7828369140625
      ],
      "text": "evidence, the choice of screening interval should be guided by feasibility. To the extent possible,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        637.539794921875,
        527.4378662109375,
        651.9827880859375
      ],
      "text": "community screening should be combined with screening for other diseases or risk factors and with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        650.7398071289062,
        527.3925170898438,
        665.1828002929688
      ],
      "text": "health-promotion or social support activities. When screening is done in refugee camps and among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.1458129882812,
        524.4006958007812,
        678.3828125
      ],
      "text": "Tuberculosis care and control in refugee and displaced populations (18) displaced populations, consult",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.995549201965332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        677.1397705078125,
        410.9371032714844,
        691.582763671875
      ],
      "text": "for recommendations on TB management and operational considerations.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        243.206298828125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for systematic screening for TB disease in targeted populations 15",
